      "writtenOn": "2026-08-10T17:09:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it doesn\u0027t affect anything with fan control/Availability checking, the fanctl fix could probably be its own commit as well. That way, this commit just adds the checking for the property. Might also be good to say how the fanctl change was tested.",
